              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aharondokhana nolwakho lwaGadi, khulubeka Iwesautsi olwakho lularule eTamari luule khumatsi kaMeribatsi-kadeshi, lulondoole khuMuchela kwaMisiri, okhuula khuNyanza Ikhongo. ",
