              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshio nishio eshialo eshia mulakhupile ikha nimukabulila tsimbia tsiaIsiraeli khulwa obulaame; khandi echio nichio emikabo chiatsio, lulala lulala; nolwa Omwami NYASAYE aboola.",
          "type": "text",
