        {
          "text": "Elubeka Iwebukwe, oluchelwa amakhono ebikhumila bine ebikhumi biraano, ebilibwa bitaru; mbu eshilibwa shiaYusufu, neshilibwa shiaBenyamini, neshilibwa shiaDano. ",
