        {
          "text": "Elubeka Iwesautsi, oluchelwa amakhono ebikhumila bine ebikhumi biraano, ebilibwa bitaru; mbu eshilibwa shiaSimeoni, neshilibwa neshilibwa shiaIsakhari, neshilibwa shiaZabuloni. ",
